WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.435
-Our next guests
are two comedians

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.438
who star in the prank comedy
series "Chad &amp; JT Go Deep,"

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.773
which is streaming now
on Netflix.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.041 line:0%
Let's take a look.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.943 line:0%
-Perineum sunning is where
you allow direct sunlight

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:14.947 line:0%
to penetrate your bare sphincter
for 30 seconds or more.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:18.551 line:0%
Dr. Drew says that the sun
is a massive electric node

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.885 line:0%
in the sky --
-Mayor. Mayor.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.055 line:0%
The public speaker is allowed
to speak about something

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.557 line:0%
that is within the jurisdiction
of the city of Irvine,

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.392 line:0%
but this subject matter is not.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.227 line:0%
-Mr. Melching --
-This is a...

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.929 line:0%
-What up, Council?

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:33.099 line:0%
I would love to have my friend
and colleague Chad Kroeger

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:36.269 line:0%
demonstrate the position
for perineum sunning.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.606 line:0%
If you can redirect your
attention towards the stairs.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.641 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.378 line:0%
Thank you, Chad.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.879
-Please welcome to the show

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.215
Chad Kroeger and JT Parr,
everybody.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.217
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:58.724 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:06.232 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.234
Welcome, gentlemen.
I'm so happy to have you here.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.902
Now, for the uninformed,

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:13.206
how would you describe your show
"Chad &amp; JT Go Deep"?

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.209
-Well, Netflix basically
came to us, they were like,

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.545
"Hey, dudes, we're a big fan
of your activism.

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:20.546
Big fan of your message."
And they were like,

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:23.883
"We just want to have a camera
crew document your work."

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.119
And it ended up actually being
a pretty crazy journey.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:28.721
Like, it started off
on kind of a bad note.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.724
We accidentally got canceled...
-Yeah.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:35.561
-...for a pretty major faux pas
in the racism category.

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.230
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.732
-Well, yeah, we were trying
to protect skateboarders

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.402
because they've been, like,
persecuted in our culture.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.804
-Mm-hmm.
-But we didn't realize

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.074
that the phrase
"protect our boarders" was --
[borders]

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.310
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:56.416
I didn't know it was loaded with
such intense connotations.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.584
-Sure, well,
it's barely in the news.

00:01:58.584 --> 00:01:59.752
How could you?

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.622
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, like, the news, right?

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:03.823
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.491
-Crazy.
-How did you guys --

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:07.827
If I can ask,
how did you guys first meet?

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.329
-Oh, dude, it's a good story.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:12.631
So, we actually met
doing a four-hose beer bong,

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:13.967
the Mount Chugmore.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.471
Which you can get on Amazon
for $23.99.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.040
And so, there were three
other dudes --

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.541
Landon, Reece, and Kellen --

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:25.211
but Reece had to sub out
'cause he was on antibiotics.

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.712
-Mm-hmm.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:29.882
-And JT subbed in and it was
like a cosmic connection.

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:32.985
-Dude, yeah.
I'm just chugging to be a bro,

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:34.486
and then I look over,

00:02:34.486 --> 00:02:38.157
and me and Chad just made
the most powerful eye contact.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.592
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:42.929
And we kind of haven't stopped
looking at each other since.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.430
-Wow.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.601
Now, you mentioned, Chad, you
refer to yourself as activists.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:52.605
How would you describe or define
your activism?

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.873
-I'd say the main thing
with our activism

00:02:54.873 --> 00:02:56.709
is the pursuit of stoke.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.377
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:00.879
You know, like, we started out

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:03.048
asking the city council
of San Clemente

00:03:03.048 --> 00:03:04.717
to erect a statue
of Paul Walker.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.218
-Mm-hmm.
-'Cause, um...

00:03:06.218 --> 00:03:08.988
-Of "Fast and the Furious" fame.
-"Fast and Furious," yeah, yeah.

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:11.323
Because it was at the time,
not unlike now,

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.593
when the country is super
divided, and we were, like,

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.928
you know, "Who is a unifying
figure in our life?"

00:03:15.928 --> 00:03:17.096
Paul Walker.

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.197
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:20.366
We think that can unite
the "nayshe."

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:23.169
And so, it just came from there

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:25.438
and then we've been just
pursuing causes

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:27.774
just to get everyone fired up
and frothing again.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:32.678
-Yeah.
Have people from the "Fast 5,"

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:35.014
"Fast and the Furious" franchise
reached out?

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.449
'Cause obviously,
you guys are fans.

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.117
-Yeah, actually,
we became friends

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:41.453
with Jordana Brewster,
who plays Mia Toretto.

00:03:41.453 --> 00:03:43.756
And we got to go to her wedding

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:46.092
where she married
our main dawg Mason.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:49.996
And Vin Diesel was there, and we
got to take a photo with him.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.164
-Yeah.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.666
He seemed so excited
to take it with you guys.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:55.401
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.503 --> 00:04:00.206
-Yeah.
We kind of bum-rushed him.

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.475
-Yeah.
-And to be totally candid,

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.577
we were on a lot of mushrooms
at the time.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:05.845
[ Laughter ]
-'Cause I feel like

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:07.847
if he was down to pose
for one...

00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:10.216
you might have taken a second
one that you were in, Chad?

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:12.351
-Right, yeah.
I did...yeah.

00:04:12.351 --> 00:04:13.519
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:15.354
I got a little boned
on the framing there.

00:04:15.354 --> 00:04:17.523
-You got a little boned
on the framing.

00:04:17.523 --> 00:04:19.358
Hey, you know,
we saw in the clip

00:04:19.358 --> 00:04:21.126
and obviously you mentioned,
you know,

00:04:21.126 --> 00:04:23.896
for the Paul Walker statue,
you obviously go

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:26.899
in front of city councils often
for your activism.

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:29.001
Have you reached out
to other city councils

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:30.836
other than sort of near home?

00:04:30.836 --> 00:04:32.938
-Yeah, we went to Greenville,
South Carolina,

00:04:32.938 --> 00:04:36.275
to pay homage
to the Queen who passed.

00:04:36.275 --> 00:04:38.110
And we were a couple weeks late

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.279
'cause we had been
at a silent retreat.

00:04:40.279 --> 00:04:44.616
But they ended up cutting me off

00:04:44.616 --> 00:04:48.454
before I could give her
the respect she deserves.

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:50.456
I wanted to sing a song for her

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:53.459
because, you know, Princess Di
has Elton John.

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:56.095
I wanted Queen Elizabeth
to have Khalifa.

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:57.463
-Uh-huh.

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:58.965
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:01.634
But they were actually talking
about extending Main Street

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:04.470
by a couple blocks, so I was
a little off topic.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.973
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:08.975
-Yeah, we actually --
we accidentally went

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:12.078
to the planning commission,
which deals with property.

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:13.412
-Okay, gotcha.
-Yeah.

00:05:13.412 --> 00:05:17.083
-How patient would you say
they were for you guys?

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.285
-They told me to shut up
three times.

00:05:19.285 --> 00:05:22.120
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.757
-Now, Chad, I should note
you're also an actor --

00:05:24.757 --> 00:05:26.124
I was talking to you
backstage --

00:05:26.124 --> 00:05:29.295
scene-stealing in this year,
this season of "Barry."

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:30.796
There you are.
-Yeah.

00:05:30.796 --> 00:05:32.965
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:34.867
-How did that come about?

00:05:34.867 --> 00:05:36.869
Was that enjoyable for you?
-Oh, it was amazing.

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:39.172
Yeah, so, I got the audition

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:41.840
and then it turned into a Zoom
with Bill Hader,

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:45.177
who is a hero of ours
and he's just the best guy.

00:05:45.177 --> 00:05:47.679
He's just very inspiring.

00:05:47.679 --> 00:05:49.348
He's just so passionate
about his work and stuff.

00:05:49.348 --> 00:05:53.385
And he's a big fan of our stoke
and our message and our wisdom.

00:05:53.385 --> 00:05:56.322
And he's, like, basically
he's like, "Hey, dude, like,

00:05:56.322 --> 00:06:00.826
I just want you to impart your
wisdom into the Barry universe

00:06:00.826 --> 00:06:02.327
and let the characters know
what's up."

00:06:02.327 --> 00:06:04.329
-I know him -- he's always been

00:06:04.329 --> 00:06:06.165
drawn to wisdom, so it makes...

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:07.833
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:10.502
-Another hero you guys met --

00:06:10.502 --> 00:06:13.272
I believe this is a photo
of you, JT,

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:14.506
with Arnold Schwarzenegger.

00:06:14.506 --> 00:06:16.442
How did you meet him?
By the way, all your --

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:18.945
the pictures of you guys
with celebrities are so good.

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:20.612
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.612 --> 00:06:24.116
You guys obviously have
a really good camera.

00:06:24.116 --> 00:06:26.118
-Arnold reached out to us
and he wanted to lift.

00:06:26.118 --> 00:06:27.954
And we were like,
"Of course," and...

00:06:27.954 --> 00:06:29.354
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.354 --> 00:06:32.358
The thing about Arnold is,
is he's perpetually inspiring.

00:06:32.358 --> 00:06:34.360
Everything he says is inspiring.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.928
Everything about him
is contagious,

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:38.230
including his accent.
-Yeah.

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:41.300
-Yeah, he was telling us,
you know,

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.936
"During your dead lifts,
say 'I can do it.'"

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:45.037
Very inspiring.

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:47.039
And I couldn't help
but do the accent.

00:06:47.039 --> 00:06:49.375
So in front of him I was like,
[as Arnold] "I can do it!"

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:50.877
[ Laughter ]

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:52.544
And I PR'ed.

00:06:52.544 --> 00:06:54.546
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:57.216
-You PR'ed?
That's exciting.

00:06:57.216 --> 00:07:00.252
Now, you guys, is it true...

00:07:00.252 --> 00:07:04.756
Because you have appeared
on Fox News a handful of times.

00:07:04.756 --> 00:07:06.592
-12.
-12 times?

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:08.761
-Mm-hmm.
-Is it true you've been banned?

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:11.596
Do you think you currently -- do
you think you'll be asked back?

00:07:11.596 --> 00:07:14.032
-Well, what happened is, we were
speaking on a new cause

00:07:14.032 --> 00:07:17.203
that we were really
passionate about.

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:20.206
And we went on there
and we told the world

00:07:20.206 --> 00:07:22.808
that we have small penises.

00:07:22.808 --> 00:07:24.276
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.276 --> 00:07:27.046
Because there's a lot of shame
around that across the globe,

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:28.714
and we wanted to destigmatize it

00:07:28.714 --> 00:07:31.050
and we wanted dudes
to feel comfortable.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.285
And in retrospect,
we probably should have

00:07:33.285 --> 00:07:35.121
given Fox a heads-up.
-Yeah.

00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:36.956
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:39.959
What did they think
you were gonna talk --

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:41.293
Did they have any sense of --

00:07:41.293 --> 00:07:43.629
-We were supposed to talk
about the Super Bowl.

00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:45.331
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.965 --> 00:07:48.467
-This was our Super Bowl.

00:07:48.467 --> 00:07:50.136 line:0%
-In case anybody was wondering,
they really were.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:53.138 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.138 --> 00:07:56.975 line:0%
To be fair, based on how
professional you were dressed,

00:07:56.975 --> 00:07:59.645 line:0%
they couldn't possibly have
known something was coming.

00:07:59.645 --> 00:08:00.645
-Yeah.

00:08:00.645 --> 00:08:02.648
I wore my
first communion outfit.

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:03.816
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.816 --> 00:08:05.484
-Hey, gentlemen,
congrats on the show,

00:08:05.484 --> 00:08:06.985
and thanks so much
for making time for us.

00:08:06.985 --> 00:08:09.655
That's Chad Kroeger and JT Parr.
-Thank you!

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:11.857
-"Chad &amp; JT Go Deep"
is streaming now on Netflix.

00:08:11.857 --> 00:08:13.192
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night."

